1
00:00:08,934 --> 00:00:23,824
I am exhausted. My new exercise class is so hard.

2
00:00:23,824 --> 00:00:26,802
Your new exercise class?

3
00:00:26,802 --> 00:00:35,736
Yeah. My new advanced exercise class.

4
00:00:35,736 --> 00:00:38,714
Why advanced?

5
00:00:38,714 --> 00:00:41,950
My instructor thought that

6
00:00:41,950 --> 00:00:46,589
the beginner's class was too easy for me.

7
00:00:46,589 --> 00:00:50,792
Too easy for you?

8
00:00:50,792 --> 00:00:53,292
Don't laugh. In the beginner's class,

9
00:00:53,292 --> 00:00:56,581
they give you a chance to rest between exercises.

10
00:00:56,581 --> 00:00:57,068
So?

11
00:00:57,068 --> 00:00:59,559
The advanced class is nonstop.

12
00:00:59,559 --> 00:01:04,280
I lift weights every morning for sixty minutes

13
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:05,515
without stopping.

14
00:01:05,515 --> 00:01:08,493
No problem.

15
00:01:08,493 --> 00:01:11,471
Listen, Richard,

16
00:01:11,471 --> 00:01:15,001
doing aerobics for an hour is a lot different than lifting weights.

17
00:01:15,001 --> 00:01:17,760
Yeah. Quite a bit different.

18
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:19,427
I think aerobics is easy.

19
00:01:19,427 --> 00:01:23,383
I could work out in your class with no problem.

20
00:01:23,383 --> 00:01:27,028
You think so?

21
00:01:27,028 --> 00:01:28,861
Oh, without a doubt.

22
00:01:28,861 --> 00:01:30,539
When's the next class?

23
00:01:30,539 --> 00:01:35,295
Tomorrow morning at ten o'clock. Try it.

24
00:01:35,295 --> 00:01:39,319
Tomorrow morning after lifting weights,

25
00:01:39,319 --> 00:01:40,364
I'll try aerobics.

26
00:01:40,364 --> 00:01:45,829
It's a nap. Tomorrow morning at ten o'clock.

27
00:01:45,829 --> 00:02:01,785
Aren't you going to the aerobics class this morning?

28
00:02:01,785 --> 00:02:03,916
Of Course. Easy. No sweat.

29
00:02:03,916 --> 00:02:12,905
You are not going to be able to move

30
00:02:12,905 --> 00:02:16,031
after this and the aerobics class.

31
00:02:16,031 --> 00:02:16,986
Are you kidding me?

32
00:02:16,986 --> 00:02:19,573
It's going to be a piece of cake.

33
00:02:19,573 --> 00:02:22,942
You want to bet?

34
00:02:22,942 --> 00:02:25,920
Yeah. What's the bet?

35
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:32,241
I bet I can go one hour in your class this morning

36
00:02:32,241 --> 00:02:34,066
and not feel a thing!

37
00:02:34,066 --> 00:02:43,788
The bet is -- I win, and you cook dinner for the entire family.

38
00:02:43,788 --> 00:02:47,655
Or you win, and I cook dinner for the entire family.

39
00:02:47,655 --> 00:02:48,322
It's a bet.

40
00:02:48,322 --> 00:02:53,293
Ok. Call my instructor, Jack Davis, right now.

41
00:02:53,293 --> 00:02:55,700
His number is 555-8842.

42
00:02:55,700 --> 00:02:59,370
The advanced class starts at ten o'clock.

43
00:02:59,370 --> 00:03:00,524
Well, it's eight twenty now.

44
00:03:00,524 --> 00:03:03,292
It only takes eight minutes by bicycle to the aerobics class.

45
00:03:03,292 --> 00:03:04,383
Give him a call.

46
00:03:04,383 --> 00:03:17,545
Davis Aerobics Center for Good Health.

47
00:03:17,545 --> 00:03:20,016
Jack Davis, please.

48
00:03:20,016 --> 00:03:21,003
This is Jack Davis.

49
00:03:21,003 --> 00:03:22,236
Hello. This is Richard Stewart.

50
00:03:22,236 --> 00:03:26,275
My wife, Marilyn Stewart, is a member of your program.

51
00:03:26,275 --> 00:03:27,603
I'd like to come to

52
00:03:27,603 --> 00:03:29,737
the ten o'clock advanced class this morning.

53
00:03:29,737 --> 00:03:32,915
Oh, fine, fine. Be here a few minutes early.

54
00:03:32,915 --> 00:03:35,946
You need to complete some forms before the class.

55
00:03:35,946 --> 00:03:38,391
Thanks. I'm on my way over.

56
00:03:38,391 --> 00:03:39,391
Good-bye.

57
00:03:39,391 --> 00:03:49,303
Bye-bye. It's all set. I'm going.

58
00:03:49,303 --> 00:03:50,303
Bye.

59
00:03:50,303 --> 00:03:51,303
See you later.

60
00:03:51,303 --> 00:03:52,281
Good luck.

61
00:03:52,281 --> 00:03:55,629
Don't forget about the bet.

62
00:03:55,629 --> 00:03:57,479
Dinner for the entire family.

63
00:03:57,479 --> 00:03:59,237
And that includes Susan.

64
00:03:59,237 --> 00:04:02,237
Don't you forget.
